Roger,

Check capabilities() to be sure that 'cairo' shows as TRUE.

If it shows FALSE, be sure to install the cairo and cairo-devel RPMs and 
re-build R so that cairo support is available. You may just need the 
'cairo-devel' RPM if the 'cairo' RPM is already present.

Also, as an aside, F7 went EOL on June 13.

If that is not helpful, post back.

Regards,

Marc


